        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Gillow, Robert Gillow\n- Companies: Gillows of Lancaster and London\n- Places: Lancaster, London\n- Roles: architect, businessman, carpenter, founder\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Gillow founded Gillows of Lancaster and London in Lancaster around 1730.\n- Robert Gillow was a carpenter and the founder of Gillows of Lancaster and London.\n- Gillows of Lancaster and London was a successful cabinet-making firm based in Lancaster and London.\n- Richard Gillow was born in 1733 and died in 1811.\n- Richard Gillow was an English architect and businessman from Lancaster.\n- Richard Gillow was the son of Robert Gillow.",
